(o) to determine the form, provide for the custody and regulate the use of the common seal of the University.]
The Senate may, subject to the provisions of this Act, delegate all or any of its powers and functions, to any Authority, committee, Officer at its additional campus, if any, for the purpose of exercising such powers and performing such functions in relation to such peripheral campuses, and for this purpose the Senate may create new posts or positions at the peripheral campuses.
